{"text":"[seriously] Escolher oficina no chute pode te custar mil e duzentos reais. [sighs] Placa na rua, indicação do cunhado... [frustrated] e você só descobre na hora de pagar. [confident] No BoxMonitor, as oficinas aparecem pela avaliação. De quem deixou o carro lá e retirou. [impressed] Quatro vírgula oito, trinta e duas avaliações. Escolhe o horário livre e agenda ali mesmo. [relieved] Sem chute e sem cunhado, sabe? [playfully] Salva esse antes de escolher a próxima oficina.","voice":"YU8EsJtXFMyKMxYtheDk","settings":"{\"model\":\"eleven_v4\",\"stability\":0.3,\"similarity_boost\":0.8}","seconds":26.08,"charStarts":[0,0.027,0.031,0.036,0.04,0.042,0.044,0.047,0.049,0.051,0.053,0.067,0.08,0.12,0.16,0.213,0.267,0.32,0.347,0.373,0.4,0.48,0.52,0.56,0.624,0.688,0.752,0.816,0.88,0.96,1,1.04,1.12,1.16,1.2,1.307,1.413,1.52,1.6,1.68,1.707,1.733,1.76,1.84,1.88,1.92,2.04,2.07,2.1,2.13,2.16,2.2,2.24,2.48,2.533,2.587,2.64,2.693,2.747,2.8,2.84,2.88,2.94,3,3.06,3.12,3.16,3.2,3.28,3.36,3.44,3.547,3.653,3.76,3.92,4.08,4.12,4.16,4.24,4.32,4.4,4.64,4.68,4.72,4.76,4.8,4.853,4.907,4.96,5.04,5.08,5.12,5.2,5.32,5.44,5.6,5.72,5.84,5.867,5.893,5.92,5.987,6.053,6.12,6.187,6.253,6.32,6.36,6.38,6.4,6.44,6.48,6.52,6.56,6.72,6.827,6.933,7.04,7.107,7.173,7.24,7.44,7.451,7.457,7.463,7.466,7.469,7.471,7.474,7.477,7.48,7.483,7.486,7.497,7.509,7.52,7.56,7.6,7.653,7.707,7.76,7.84,7.92,7.96,8,8.08,8.16,8.24,8.32,8.36,8.4,8.44,8.48,8.56,8.6,8.64,8.72,8.74,8.76,8.78,8.8,8.88,8.92,8.96,9.08,9.12,9.16,9.2,9.32,9.44,9.64,9.84,9.853,9.857,9.86,9.863,9.867,9.869,9.872,9.875,9.877,9.88,9.893,9.907,9.913,9.92,10,10.107,10.213,10.32,10.377,10.434,10.491,10.549,10.606,10.663,10.72,10.8,10.88,10.92,10.96,11.04,11.08,11.12,11.2,11.28,11.32,11.36,11.4,11.44,11.6,11.64,11.68,11.733,11.787,11.84,11.92,12,12.08,12.16,12.24,12.267,12.293,12.32,12.48,12.52,12.56,12.64,12.72,12.8,12.88,13.04,13.2,13.36,13.413,13.467,13.493,13.52,13.573,13.6,13.627,13.653,13.68,13.72,13.74,13.76,13.84,13.92,13.94,13.96,14,14.08,14.16,